tion": "Welcome to Quackville.\nWhere did everybody go?\n\nAn empty town. A curious little duck. And something that feels just a little\u2026 off. You could turn around. You could mind your own business. But there might be gold, and surely a quick look around couldn\u2019t hurt.\n\n{1116514644294360}\n\nWhat could possibly go wrong?\n\n{1104012692610177}\n\nNOPE. NOPE. NOPE.\n\n{1116269770793011}\n\nThis town is hiding something.\nFeeling brave, little duck?\n\n\n", "short_description": "Something\u2019s wrong in Quackville. There\u2019s gold in this ghost town... and something creeping around every corner. Get rich. Gear up. Try to make it through the night. Feeling brave, little duck?"}]}, "developer_name": "Team GR", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://duckzvr.pages.dev/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Team GR", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://duckzvr.pages.dev/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "644354873106712"}, {"id": "1023770785722696"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER", "CO_OP"], "id": "29155490717413497"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/593784242_2156273925263166_1425077214465641348_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dq8XUxVpyN0Q7kNvwG5wCc5&_nc_o